00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:43.340
Preview
Analysis of Ms. Yoshinoya!

00:23:43.340 --> 00:23:45.040
Preview
She can keep dancing the samba
without getting tired,

00:23:45.040 --> 00:23:46.910
Preview
but she's incredibly weak against the principal.

00:23:46.910 --> 00:23:49.380
Preview
She has magical hands that
can create any outfit.

00:23:49.380 --> 00:23:52.210
Preview
She has long hair that can block
her neck against UV rays.

00:23:52.210 --> 00:23:53.510
Preview
She'll wear a swimsuit and
an apron even in winter.

00:23:53.510 --> 00:23:54.950
Preview
She brings her own maracas
when she goes to karaoke.

00:23:54.950 --> 00:23:57.750
Preview
That's probably only one percent of the
things we can say about her, isn't it?

00:23:57.750 --> 00:24:01.120
Preview
Someone was talking about me again!

00:24:01.120 --> 00:24:05.430
Preview
The next episode is
"October 5, Restless Summer"

00:24:05.430 --> 00:24:07.290
Preview
We'll be waiting at Yamabuki High School.

00:24:07.290 --> 00:24:09.100
Preview
Be sure to tune in!

